  "invariants": [
    "A sponsor policy can never relax platform hard controls, protective holds, sanctions or destination proof (ADV-032, ADV-040, ADV-585)",
    "Approver is never the author (segregation of duties)",
    "Transactions and issued documents pin the policy version they used; activation never rewrites as-issued decisions (ADV-590)",
    "Exactly one version is active per policy key and effective time",
    "A version that depends on a board delegation is suspended when the delegation lapses; routine approvals revert to human (RCD-005)"
  ]
